# Keep the Docker build context small and never bake local secrets or build
# caches into an image (the Dockerfiles install dependencies and build from source).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/generated
**/coverage

.git
.github
.DS_Store

# Local secrets. `.env.example` files are not ignored: they carry no secrets.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

docs
README.md
LICENSE
.railway
